        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Depths of Darkness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RADIOACTIVE, INC. invites you to the decaying, dangerous halls of a deserted nuclear research complex. Face your fears across <strong>20 unique levels</strong>, each filled with new horrors, secrets, and challenges. Uncover the mysteries behind failed experiments, hidden agendas, and the feeling that something is always watching you… Are you brave enough to continue? <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879670/extras/7f04938aee8230393bc1e4aa89d7a810.poster.avif?t=1772389509\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879670/extras/7f04938aee8230393bc1e4aa89d7a810.webm?t=1772389509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879670/extras/7f04938aee8230393bc1e4aa89d7a810.mp4?t=1772389509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879670/extras/b36715d621bc831d8e3d367778c745b0.poster.avif?t=1772389509\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879670/extras/b36715d621bc831d8e3d367778c745b0.webm?t=1772389509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879670/extras/b36715d621bc831d8e3d367778c745b0.mp4?t=1772389509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro PS1-Style Graphics:</strong> Experience nostalgic 90s horror with lo-fi visuals, gritty textures, and unsettling lighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 Distinct Levels:</strong> Each chapter presents new dangers, traps, puzzles, and scares. Navigate leaking reactor chambers, rotten laboratories, and forgotten offices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Co-op Gameplay:</strong> Play alone for a pure horror experience or team up with friends to survive together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival and Escape:</strong> Hide from threats, collect clues, solve puzzles, and find your way out before it’s too late.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Soundtrack:</strong> Tense ambient sounds and immersive music ramp up the suspense with every step.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will You Dare to Escape?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RADIOACTIVE, INC. opens the doors to a nightmare full of secrets. Can you escape the darkness, reach the end of all chapters, and reveal the truth behind the corporation?</p>",
