 lighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 Distinct Levels:</strong> Each chapter presents new dangers, traps, puzzles, and scares. Navigate leaking reactor chambers, rotten laboratories, and forgotten offices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Co-op Gameplay:</strong> Play alone for a pure horror experience or team up with friends to survive together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival and Escape:</strong> Hide from threats, collect clues, solve puzzles, and find your way out before it’s too late.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Soundtrack:</strong> Tense ambient sounds and immersive music ramp up the suspense with every step.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will You Dare to Escape?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RADIOACTIVE, INC. opens the doors to a nightmare full of secrets. Can you escape the darkness, reach the end of all chapters, and reveal the truth behind the corporation?</p>",
